reasons=[
('direct_LK_mechanism_component_with_additional_authored_kinetics_and_solvent_transfer','The actual HE39 LK bullet explicitly differentiates SN1 at tertiary and SN2 at primary carbon and asks inductive/steric effects. The whole target interpreting kinetics/solvent/substrate is scientifically connected: rate-limiting ionisation versus concerted bimolecular attack motivates different concentration dependence; carbocation stabilisation, steric approach and solvation influence competition. It must not become a universal primary/tertiary or solvent rule independent of nucleophile/leaving group/conditions. Kinetic orders and solvent choices are explanatory transfer dimensions, not literally enumerated separate source bullets. The retained broad c2d3 cluster and its donor/acceptor, equation and halide-test children do not by their three actual descriptions separately certify all the LK mechanism differentiation. No historical exact edge is promoted into new whole-source approval.','Keep the LK-specific primary/tertiary contrast and inductive/steric mechanisms explicitly assessable in a later operative witness; retain equations, donor/acceptor and chloride/bromide detection duties. No finite new P cases or laboratory execution are present in this source-role input.'),
('authored_comparison_of_optional_RP_derivative_examples','Actual RP40 raster separates left Fundamentum, right LK Additum and a full-width optional deepening block. Acid amides, anhydrides and chlorides are in that optional block; the source does not literally require this three-analyte ranking as compulsory LK content. Comparing acid chloride/anhydride/ester for comparable nucleophilic acyl substitution is sound when comparable acyl group/nucleophile/solvent/temperature are held: leaving-group stability/basicity and carbonyl donation/electrophilicity explain relative tendency. It is not a ranking for arbitrary chlorides or all conditions. The actual original optional clause also includes amides and pharmaceutical/polymer links; this target cannot stand for all those items. All15 original mapped partners and their25 current whole partner/descendant bodies are preserved; their historical mapped verdict is not reapproved.','Preserve original amide and every partner/operator. New role is an explicitly authored comparative transfer, not literal HE compulsory content or RP LK Additum. RP extraction sourceRef S21/passage.page21 and courseLevelLK remain historical metadata requiring honest actual40/optional scope in any operative successor.'),
('authored_intramolecular_ester_formation_transfer','Actual HE39 Q1.3 requires the ester class, nomenclature, structure representations, condensation and mechanism; it does not literally mention lactones or a universal ring-stability law. Using specified hydroxycarboxylic-acid structures for intramolecular ester formation is a genuine chemical transfer: hydroxyl oxygen joins the carboxyl carbon, the ring includes ester oxygen and carbonyl carbon, and water is the condensation product in the model. Ring strain/conformation and reaction conditions/equilibrium affect relative formation/stability; supplied comparison data are needed, so the actual conditional goal avoids a blanket five/six-ring rule. Ester naming, observations/properties/applications and actual mechanistic partner98ae remain distinct duties.','Keep whole70b and98ae partners, original2partial edges and nomenclature/structural-mechanism gaps. This single conditional LK transfer does not silently replace the whole GK/LK ester class source group or approve every listed jurisdiction.'),
('authored_provided_data_redox_evaluation_transfer','Actual HE40 Q1.5 basic-level clause is qualitative detection of ascorbic acid as antioxidant. The target instead evaluates supplied redox/comparison data and explicitly distinguishes antioxidant effect from antimicrobial preservation. Ascorbic acid may donate reducing equivalents and be oxidised while an oxidant is reduced; delay of oxidation alone does not establish inhibition of microbial growth, storage safety or product permission. Whole db666 partner still requires carrying out the qualitative reagent test and explaining its observed reduction. Provided data in this extra LK evaluation do not waive that actual conduct duty.','Q1.5 is outside the compulsory Q1 fields1–3 stated on actual HE38; apply the selected-theme context and its basic/LK internal levels faithfully. No universal LK duty, actual experiment, therapeutic efficacy or food-safety approval follows from this candidate.'),
('authored_specified_paraben_analytical_transfer_not_literal_use_clause','Actual HE40 Q1.5 LK B05 concerns use of p-hydroxybenzoic-acid esters; quantitative B04 concerns ascorbic acid. A specified paraben quantitative-method selection/planning/conduct/controls/calibration or stoichiometry/dilution/limits goal is a scientifically coherent additional analytical application, but B05 use alone does not witness its quantitative operator and B04 must not be relabelled as paraben. Method selection must address matrix/selectivity and the specified ester; a generic acid-base titration cannot be assumed to give a universal paraben stoichiometry. Its actual whole description retains conduct. Original0d59 use-evaluation partner and d3cd quantitative parent with separate3d669 ascorbic and18819 paraben children remain; no operator is dropped.','This entry contains no new operative quantitative P case or executed experiment. Retain both child goals and use operator; require genuinely suitable finite operative material plus actual normal current source/page bindings later. This is a bounded authored relation, never literal source fulfilment or whole-course approval.')]
